==German==

===Adjective===
{{head|de|adjective}}

# {{lb|de|regional|chiefly|northern Germany|chiefly|colloquial|slang}} {{alternative form of|derb|lang=de}}
#: ''Der Typ is’ echt '''derbe'''.''
#:: That guy’s really '''rough''' (≈ '''cool''').

====Usage notes====
* The form is used in northern German slang to describe a kind of “rough coolness” but is also an [[expletive]]. — It is rarely used quite synonymously with {{m|de|derb}} but is undistinguishable from it in all inflected forms.

